  "_note": "Clean-room from the TI SN74LS193 datasheet pinout: 4-bit synchronous up/down binary counter, DIP16. Two clocks (UP pin 5, DOWN pin 4) and no mode pin; hold the idle one high. /LOAD is ASYNCHRONOUS unlike the 74LS161. CLEAR is active HIGH. Terminal names follow the engine model (d0-d3, q0-q3) so the family reads the same way, not the datasheet A-D/QA-QD."
